gantt
    title 产品上线排期（模拟数据）
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %m/%d
    tickInterval 1week
    todayMarker off
    section 设计
    需求梳理 :done, research, 2026-11-02, 3d
    交互与视觉 :done, design, after research, 5d
    设计冻结 :milestone, freeze, after design, 0d
    section 实现
    前端开发 :crit, active, dev, after freeze, 10d
    内容准备 :content, after freeze, 7d
    section 交付
    联调验收 :crit, qa, after dev content, 5d
    正式上线 :milestone, launch, after qa, 0d
